{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/c56c5b67536dc9702f4d38f95a11b5fc.poster.avif?t=1770830782\" width=616 height=103 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/c56c5b67536dc9702f4d38f95a11b5fc.webm?t=1770830782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing Strange Here is a cozy mystery adventure where <strong>your choices</strong> shape the town of Larcenest Gap. Meet quirky locals, <strong>take on strange quests</strong>, and use your camera to capture <strong>memorable moments</strong>. Turn those moments into articles that <strong>influence how the world reacts</strong> with cozy, funny or even mysterious outcomes.. it\u2019s up to you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover <strong>hidden secrets</strong>, <strong>earn achievements</strong> and <strong>collect stickers. </strong>Then\u00a0build your own scrapbook filled with your <strong>own stories</strong>. All of this, while <strong>investigating a mystery</strong> that runs deeper than the headlines. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/69fcaffdf6961d063ebc78433edea368.poster.avif?t=1770830782\" width=616 height=103 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/69fcaffdf6961d063ebc78433edea368.webm?t=1770830782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/73e0533512736afebde7d1cea6a2c9db.poster.avif?t=1770830782\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/73e0533512736afebde7d1cea6a2c9db.webm?t=1770830782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wander through an open world full of life.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around every corner there are strange sights, and cozy moments waiting to be found. From mysterious forests to quirky city streets, every area in Larcenest Gap is handcrafted for curious players who love to explore, snap photos, and uncover hidden surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/d794888c790f14bdf6c0c67f7b57640b.poster.avif?t=1770830782\" width=616 height=103 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/d794888c790f14bdf6c0c67f7b57640b.webm?t=1770830782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/c14613cfa0fc695e6505256127f3b149.poster.avif?t=1770830782\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/c14613cfa0fc695e6505256127f3b149.webm?t=1770830782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something\u2019s off in Larcenest Gap.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the new journalist in town, you\u2019re here to find the truth. Investigate hidden mysteries that go beyond your job description and help the locals solve their bizarre problems. Your choices shape the world you live in.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/62f709f63de13f48f1a27e8dfcd3aa04.poster.avif?t=1770830782\" width=616 height=103 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/62f709f63de13f48f1a27e8dfcd3aa04.webm?t=1770830782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/cb934ac05a605feb9adc2e729c6950b9.poster.avif?t=1770830782\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/cb934ac05a605feb9adc2e729c6950b9.webm?t=1770830782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices shape the town.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every quest you complete lets you choose one out of three article styles. The article you publish will change how the world reacts, from the gossip on the town\u2019s quest board to how areas look and feel. The townsfolk remember what you write\u2026 and sometimes even dress the part.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/0d029fec493a2f047b0dd77b3d05c74c.poster.avif?t=1770830782\" width=616 height=103 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/0d029fec493a2f047b0dd77b3d05c74c.webm?t=1770830782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cl